      "statement": "run-hook.sh is the shared dispatcher for Copilot, Claude Code, and Codex hooks: it resolves the repository root from its own location, then GITHUB_WORKSPACE, WORKSPACE_FOLDER, VSCODE_CWD, or PWD, then git rev-parse, exits 2 on a missing script name, and only warns and exits 0 when the named script file is missing.",
